#: credentials.php:751
msgid "A unique, meaningful name for this credential."
msgstr "Jina la kipekee na lenye maana kwa kitambulisho hiki."

#: credentials.php:759
msgid "An optional description of where this credential is used."
msgstr "Maelezo ya hiari ya mahali ambapo kitambulisho hiki kinatumika."

#: credentials.php:766
msgid "Credential Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Kitambulisho"

#: credentials.php:767
msgid "The type of credential. Changing the type on an existing credential discards the previously stored type-specific values when you save."
msgstr "Aina ya kitambulisho. Kubadilisha aina kwenye kitambulisho kilichopo hufuta thamani maalum za aina zilizohifadhiwa awali unapohifadhi."

#: credentials.php:774
msgid "Where the secret values for this credential live. Choose the local encrypted database, or an external secret store. When an external provider is selected, each secret field holds a reference the provider resolves at poll time instead of the secret itself."
msgstr "Mahali ambapo thamani za siri za kitambulisho hiki zinahifadhiwa. Chagua hifadhidata ya ndani iliyosimbwa kwa njia fiche, au hifadhi ya siri ya nje. Wakati mtoa huduma wa nje amechaguliwa, kila uga wa siri huwa na rejeleo ambalo mtoa huduma hutatua wakati wa kukusanya data badala ya siri yenyewe."

#: credentials.php:781
msgid "Whether this credential is available for use."
msgstr "Ikiwa kitambulisho hiki kinapatikana kwa matumizi."

#: credentials.php:822
msgid "(reference)"
msgstr "(rejeleo)"

#: credentials.php:879
msgid "Change Credential Type?"
msgstr "Badilisha Aina ya Kitambulisho?"

#: credentials.php:880
msgid "Changing the Credential Type will discard the values stored for the current type when you save this credential. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr "Kubadilisha Aina ya Kitambulisho kutafuta thamani zilizohifadhiwa kwa aina ya sasa unapohifadhi kitambulisho hiki. Je, unataka kuendelea?"

